 /**
  * @file
- * Same Page Preview module - backward compatibility for Drupal 10.3-11.0.
- * 
- * For Drupal 11.1+ all functionality is handled by Object-Oriented Hooks 
- * in src/Hook/SamePagePreviewHooks.php
+ * Same Page Preview — procedural hooks kept only where OOH cannot replace them.
+ *
+ * Drupal 11.1+ registers #[Hook] methods in SamePagePreviewHooks; procedural
+ * hook_* functions with the same name would be registered twice and trigger
+ * LogicException (see https://www.drupal.org/project/same_page_preview/issues/3579320).
+ *
+ * Backward compatibility for Drupal 10 without OOH is unchanged in upstream
+ * releases; this file is trimmed for Drupal 11-only sites via Composer patch.
  */
 
